:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、\n最近本格的に暑いですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前だけど生写真で\n浴衣を着ました〜(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/08/01/5125259/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーく見ると車柄。かわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リトグリちゃんを見る高山"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/08/01/5125259/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近い近い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若に撮られてました(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに音楽番組で一緒になれて\n嬉しかったんですよ〜♡\nみんな相変わらず素敵だった！！\n歌声も見た目も性格も...(ﾉ;ω;)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日マナカちゃんと\nかき氷巡りしてきたよ！\n美味でした(＊´^`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにゆっくりお話できた♪\n話すたびに本当にいい子だなって思います(´;ω;`)年齢関係なく尊敬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張らねば！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮り溜めした写真を載せたら\nもう上限になってしまう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/08/01/5125259/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週も、お仕事、そしてライブ！\n頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねー( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"}],"source":"archive"}